# Build context hygiene — keep layers small and cache-stable.
**/.DS_Store
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore
**/*.md
# the bundled skill store (devcake/skills/) IS runtime content — its
# SKILL.md files must reach the image despite the *.md exclusion above
!devcake/skills/**
